                            <comment id="16061275" author="herval" created="Fri, 23 Jun 2017 17:39:01 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Looking at the code, this controller was introduced on 0.7 (which I believe is also affected by this). It seems related to the Helium viz package. A short-term fix I can think of is to not try to &quot;commit&quot; if you&apos;re not a writer/owner. Would that make sense?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
